CORE
main.c
--pointer-check --bounds-check --unwind 3 --unwinding-assertions
^\[main\.assertion\.\d+\] line \d+ decimal point is ',': FAILURE$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
C11 7.11p2: the "C" locale's values, which are in effect at program startup.
Before, every string member of the result was a null pointer.
